+/* The last few images fingerprinted, by address and size, with a copy of
+ * their bytes: an image dispatched again from the same place is compared
+ * (memcmp, tens of bytes a cycle) instead of hashed again (FNV-1a, a
+ * multiply per byte -- the registry's fingerprints are FNV, so the hash
